{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>They have dealt corruptly with Him, not His children — their blemish: a generation crooked and perverse.</b> Rather, it is the generation crooked and perverse who are not His children in integrity — this is their blemish in the [Golden] Calf. They dealt corruptly with the Exalted El regarding that which He had ordained, as it says: כִּי שִׁחֵת עַמְּךָ (Exodus 32:7). For He indeed intended to sanctify Israel and to sanctify His name in the world through them, so that they would be luminaries among the human species, to understand and to instruct, as it says: כִּי לִי כָּל הָאָרֶץ וְאַתֶּם תִּהְיוּ לִי מַמְלֶכֶת כֹּהֲנִים (Exodus 19:5–6). And they corrupted all of this in the [Golden] Calf."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:54.608764772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}